{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15109090","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15109090","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:5:1510909001:1":{"text":"天空变红了……血月又要来了？","source_cn":"天空变红了……血月又要来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC65B12F8B50A7ADB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1510909002:1":{"text":"蒙多没有卜算到……","source_cn":"蒙多没有卜算到……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBBC75930C9F6860","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510909003:0":{"text":"血月来了，应该是吉兆。但是，感觉不一样……","source_cn":"血月来了，应该是吉兆。但是，感觉不一样……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8B6EB5E2756F79F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1510909004:0":{"text":"血月也是狩猎神象征。她很可能要<style=\"highlight\">降临战场</style>，水晶刚才的异变也预兆着这一点。","source_cn":"血月也是狩猎神象征。她很可能要<style=highl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA24FDF5D68AA572","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1510909005:0":{"text":"我们得尽快<style=\"highlight\">追上珀尔修斯</style>。如果无法阻止战争，呼临城的覆灭将无法改写！","source_cn":"我们得尽快<style=highlight>追上珀尔修...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8270C6EE4269B5B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1510909006:0":{"text":"我和你们一起去。","source_cn":"我和你们一起去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34F0C6CB96B0D9E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1510909007:1":{"text":"你去干什么？双方的刀都会瞄准你。","source_cn":"你去干什么？双方的刀都会瞄准你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63BED4BE7D66054F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1510909008:1":{"text":"少废话。你们答应过，要<style=\"highlight\">杀了狩猎神</style>。","source_cn":"少废话。你们答应过，要<style=highlight...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEE28E42B30A2A138","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1510909009:1":{"text":"哦，差点忘了，你是个想弑神的“信徒”。","source_cn":"哦，差点忘了，你是个想弑神的“信徒”。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32446D8752E58063","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1510909010:0":{"text":"可以，来吧。你至少能帮我们挡几刀。","source_cn":"可以，来吧。你至少能帮我们挡几刀。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFBAB0A5D2C1C956B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1510909011:0":{"text":"那非，你、你为什么……？！","source_cn":"那非，你、你为什么……？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCAC98B441D241D60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1510909012:1":{"text":"加拉，如果你想保护<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，就好好想想神到底是什么。","source_cn":"加拉，如果你想保护<style=stress><pla...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x4AB2DC504EFEB8CE","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"加拉，如果你想保护<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，就好好想想神到底是什么。","female":"加拉，如果你想保护<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style>，就好好想想神到底是什么。","variant_male_record_index":"175277","variant_female_record_index":"175278","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1510909013:1":{"text":"以及，怎么做才能阻止那残暴的神。","source_cn":"以及，怎么做才能阻止那残暴的神。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81DE3C8BF02970BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1510909014:1":{"text":"你没有多少机会，因为她差点就杀死了你。","source_cn":"你没有多少机会，因为她差点就杀死了你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6627B89C3082CD62","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1510909015:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……<key:dialog71>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x211F7AC2CA3C9A12","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:25:150109152:0":{"text":"红雾弥漫，血月已至。